# Nothing is required here: the model settings come from the repo-root .env, which the agent loads:
#   OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000   the LiteLLM gateway
#   OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...                    a LiteLLM key
# The agent's model is MODEL in task_worker/agent.py (gpt-4o-mini), a name your gateway must know.

# Optional: keep the board somewhere else (default: board.sqlite in this folder)
# BOARD_PATH=/path/to/board.sqlite
